  "summary": "Built the plan's local proof lanes with no GitHub Actions minutes. Harness pastes go through one per-project clipboardTransport and fail unless a newer paste-tagged commit changes the document; the browser handle and kernel-trace retention attach only after installBrowserHandle() from plitejs/react, re-exported by platejs/react. A private Android lane in packages/test/src/device types with real Gboard touches over adb behind a guarded DevTools relay, gates each case on a structural witness, records known product failures by their observed values, and leaves the device as found. A macOS lane for #5137 is built but has not run. Two rounds of a three-seat panel and two decision-trail reviews were applied.",
