      }
    ],
    "limits": "The #5137 macOS lane never selected Pinyin - Simplified, so neither its helper typing nor its gated spec ran. iOS is quarantined: Xcode 26.6 needs the iOS 26.5 platform. A production platejs/react import still carries the handle, and no check guards the plitejs/react production bundle. The DOM-only production control and two benchmark drivers did not run. Device proof covers one emulator and Gboard 17.0.14; physical phones and other keyboards are unproven. The Apple converted spaces paste test was attributed under the old transport in this tree, not at HEAD. Deferred panel items: canceled-beforeinput pairing, restored-tab cleanup, a typed last-commit read and rebuilding the recorder on the lane."
